"P1936553701" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Your old existence is over. Embrace your new identity."
// Script Variable ENGINEER_DEVOURED_INACTIVE :
"P3217026759" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>You are flawed. We will perfect you."
// Script Variable ENGINEER_DEVOURED_ACTIVE :
"P3480322966" "{HeroName}, you were not expected, not yet."
// Script Variable ENGINEER_DEVOURED_ACTIVE :
"P1547118758" "You will make an excellent part of Hamidon, {HeroName}."
