// Script Variable AMBUSH_TEXT :
"P4124380792" "<shout>You had your chance, {HeroName}. It could have been easier."
// Script Variable AMBUSH_TEXT :
"P3477445104" "<shout>The world will be remade, it will be born a new."
// Script Variable AMBUSH_TEXT :
"P2767158234" "<shout>Beauty will cover this world, a beauty that no human could imagine."
// Script Variable AMBUSH_TEXT :
"P3276697434" "<shout>I would protect the world from destruction. Why would you wish to stop this?"
// Script Variable AMBUSH_TEXT :
"P1229910057" "<shout>Humanity's imperfection doomed them from the start. Give in."
