"P1826405325" "You fought Shadow Hunter in Hamidon's forest and defeated him. The predator ran off after being badly defeated.<br><br>It's surprising that Shadow Hunter is even <i>alive</i> after the Magisterium. You have to wonder how much of Shadow Hunter is truly left, and how much is merely the Hamidon controlling his forces."

