// Dialog :
"P1368210108" "Great work, {HeroName}! Vanguard is sending in a crew as we speak to recover the sonic fence technology and bring it back to Last Bastion.<br><br>They'll be moving quick, of course; there's only so long that Hamidon's forest will actually be <i>safe</i>.<br><br>We just received word that there was a huge explosion over in what's left of Neutropolis. It looks like Anti-Matter's reactors all went off - it was massive! I bet that put a huge dent in Hamidon, or at least, I hope it does.<br><br>In the meantime we should  take advantage of this and- er. Uh oh.<br><br>We've got a problem, {HeroName}. I don't think that should surprise you at this point, right?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Reese 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page AllReese Text :
"P4155148910" "Well, {HeroName}, looks like it's a little awkward for the two of us to meet here, eh? First there was the whole Top Dog competition, then that... unfortunate incident with the Powers Division and Warrant.<br><br>I heard the cities in Praetoria were nuked by Cole. Good riddance, I say, the place was too small time.<br><br>I was trying to help out these people in Last Bastion. Anyway, I guess you probably have some questions about things, don't you?"
// Answer Text :
"P174591553" "Why are you here?"
// Answer Text :
"P849906005" "No, Reese, no more words. It's time for you to die. (Kill Reese)"
// Page ReeseKilledWarrant Text :
"P2548687408" "Well, {HeroName}, looks like it's a little awkward for the two of us to meet here, eh? I hope you're not still upset about everything with Warrant, that was completely in the past.<br><br>I heard the cities in Praetoria were nuked by Cole. Good riddance, I say, the place was too small time.<br><br>I was trying to help out these people in Last Bastion. Anyway, I guess you probably have some questions about things, don't you?"
// Answer Text :
"P2176817144" "No, Reese, no more words. This is for Warrant! (Kill Reese)"
// Page ReeseTopDog Text :
"P820251744" "Well, {HeroName}, looks like it's a little awkward for the two of us to meet here, eh? I don't think I'd be here today if you hadn't beaten me in that competition so long ago, but that's neither here nor there... yet.<br><br>I heard the cities in Praetoria were nuked by Cole. Good riddance, I say, the place was too small time.<br><br>I was trying to help out these people in Last Bastion. Anyway, I guess you probably have some questions about things, don't you?"
// Answer Text :
"P518657431" "I never liked you, Reese. I won't let you stay here to cause trouble. (Kill Reese)"
// Page NormalReese Text :
"P320340238" "You must be {HeroName}, I've heard about you, kind of hard not to when you're throwing around all that power. Name's <color yellow>Reese</color>, I used to be a Top Dog around  Praetoria. That doesn't matter much, though, since there's nothing much left of the place.<br><br>I heard the cities in Praetoria were nuked by Cole. Good riddance, I say, the place was too small time.<br><br>I was trying to help out these people in Last Bastion. Anyway, I guess you probably have some questions about things, don't you?"
// Page WhyReese Text :
"P3902825197" "I've been roaming the world, trying to fight off the Hamidon. Figured going up against that thing was true Top Dog material, not like the amateurs that were running around like chickens with their heads cut off in Praetoria.<br><br>I heard over some transmissions about Last Bastion and figured I'd try to find the sonic fence facility myself and recover it. You... ah... well, let's just say there were more Devouring Earth here than I thought.<br><br>Look, we can talk about this all day, or you can help me get out of here. I'm willing to share some of the spotlight for now if it means keeping Praetoria one last chance."
// Answer Text :
"P1954594512" "Alright, Reese, you're with me. (Activate Reese's teleporter)"
// Answer Text :
"P3014965974" "No, Reese, this place is going to be your grave. (Kill Reese)"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4111931058" "The Vanguard team has pulled out of the warehouse. They say there's too many Devouring Earth in there. It looks like the Hamidon knows how important this place is. They also reported something odd, which was a signature of another super-powered individual in there. This person might be with the Hamidon, or they might be some poor soul that's trapped down there.<br><br>I hate to ask more of you, but..."
// AcceptString :
"P474655598" "It's up to me to get the sonic fence technology."
// SendOffString :
"P3690671499" "You read my mind! ... Wait, did you really? I hope not, I never liked mind readers. Ah... not that I don't <i>like</i> mind readers, but, well, you get what I'm trying to say.<br><br>If you can recover the sonic fence equipment, the Vanguard truck outside of the warehouse will bring it back and assemble it all to get Last Bastion.<br><br>I'd also try to investigate what that power signature is down there. It could be another ally we could use in this whole thing. Well, it could <i>also</i> be a super that Hamidon has infested, which means that we'll take down another agent of Hamidon! Good news, right?<br><br> In the meantime, I'm going to be using my abilities to scan the area near Last Bastion for any large gatherings of Devouring Earth; the attack that you stopped came from underground nearby. I think we can make things safer if we can take more of the fight to this creature!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1463582322" "Recover the Sonic Fence Technology"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2202020233" "Good luck in the warehouse!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1789599114" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: The Last Top Dog</color>"

