// Dialog :
"P127436194" "{HeroName}, we've got <i>no</i> time to talk! Last Bastion's under attack, there's a <color yellow>Seed of Hamidon</color> floating right above it!<br><br><color orange>{Hero.type=villain This is the chance you were waiting for! One last, public showdown with the Hamidon's creations!}"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Tech 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2532366050" "{HeroName}. It looks like we're in this together. I had a feeling the portal will close. I'm sure we'll get through this.<br><br>This would normally be when one of us would say we've been through worse. However, being trapped on a planet with an entity that controls all of the Earth that is trying to consume my life is, coincidentally, the worst situation I believe I've been in."
// Answer Text :
"P2621374741" "Understood. What's the situation?"
// Page BattleDataNoReese Text :
"P1911863467" "We've got groups of Devouring Earth swarming outside of the building. They've shut down the Lambda turrets as well.<br><br>If you can activate those turrets, they'll blast the Seed of Hamidon away. You'll also need to clear the Devouring Earth and the Hamidon seeds from outside.<br><br>That should give us some breathing room, but we won't be out of the woods just yet. We'll be working on getting the sonic fences powered up. Once they're on, we'll be able to repel the Devouring Earth with ease. But we need you to save the city, or else these fences will just be protecting a pile of rubble!"
// Answer Text :
"P3388139578" "Alright, I'll handle it."
// Page BattleDataReese Text :
"P1531932670" "We've got groups of Devouring Earth swarming outside of the building. However, Reese was able to take down a number of them before being forced to retreat. Unfortunately, he couldn't stop them from shutting down the Lambda turrets.<br><br>If you can activate those turrets, they'll blast the Seed of Hamidon away. You'll also need to clear the Devouring Earth and the Hamidon seeds from outside.<br><br>That should give us some breathing room, but we won't be out of the woods just yet. We'll stay in here to monitor your progress, good luck."
// Answer Text :
"P3936123470" "Alright."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - SoldierDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1423112517" "We've got reports that there are <color red>three Avatars of Hamidon</color> scaling the city's walls, {HeroName}.<br><br>We've never seen three of them together like this. Three IDF soldiers who were hurt in the initial attack are feeling confident enough that they can provide you support, if you need it.<br><br>Our engineers are almost done powering up the sonic fences. Once they're on, we're safe... but only if you can take care of those Avatars."
// Answer Text :
"P362701071" "Alright, tell the soldiers to follow my lead."
// Answer Text :
"P3308905474" "Tell the soldiers to stay behind, I'll handle this."
// Page Confirm Text :
"P1965914451" "Are you sure, {HeroName}? <color orange>Three Avatars of Hamidon are incredibly powerful, and should not be handled lightly.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3279054460" "On second thought, tell them to gear up, they're with me."
// Answer Text :
"P1976540101" "I'm positive."
// Page GoAlone Text :
"P1781926359" "Alright, Alright. I'll tell you everything I know."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Celebrant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page ChallengeReese Text :
"P220682610" "{HeroName}, you've done it! The sonic fences are back on and the city is cleared of the Devouring Earth. Lady Grey is working on re-activating the portal as we speak. The people here have set up a large hologram to remember you for all the work you've done.<br><br>I'm still amazed that you took on all the Avatars on your own... That is quite an impressive feat! It seems like there's still someone who wants to dispute that, however.<br><br><color orange>Reese wants to face you one more time in combat.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P561326335" "... Great."
// Page MissionComplete Text :
"P1341417181" "{HeroName}, you've done it! The sonic fences are back on and the city is cleared of the Devouring Earth. The way back to Primal Earth is clear. Dr. Orts will debrief you when you return."
// Answer Text :
"P591590492" "Very well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Reese 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page AllReese Text :
"P254825811" "You never could resist, could you {HeroName}? You beat me in the Magisterium, you beat me in Imperial City... And now you beat all the Avatars on your own.<br><br>I can't just sit back and let you do that, let you be the Top Dog here. <i>I</i> am the Top Dog! I am the most powerful person here! Not you... not anyone else!<br><br>Fight me, {HeroName}, fight me and I'll show you how powerful I've become!"
// Answer Text :
"P1439269797" "(Fight Reese)"
// Answer Text :
"P894589258" "No, Reese. No more fighting, we're done."
// Page ReeseKilledWarrant Text :
"P1523806384" "You never could resist, could you {HeroName}? Are you trying to show me up because of Warrant? Because I killed that pathetic member of Powers Division? I'll show you, though. I'll show everyone here! <i>I</i> am the Top Dog! I am the most powerful person here! Not you... not anyone else!<br><br>Fight me, {HeroName}, fight me and I'll show you how powerful I've become!"
// Page ReeseTopDog Text :
"P1247825326" "You never could resist, could you {HeroName}? You beat me in the Magisterium, and now you beat all the Avatars on your own.<br><br>I can't just sit back and let you do that, let you be the Top Dog here. <i>I</i> am the Top Dog! I am the most powerful person here! Not you... not anyone else!<br><br>Fight me, {HeroName}, fight me and I'll show you how powerful I've become!"
// Page NormalReese Text :
"P839172105" "You think you're the new Top Dog around here, {HeroName}? Let me tell you something. My name is Reese, and <i>I</i> am the Top Dog here, I am the last hope of Praetoria, NOT you! Not just some random Incarnate who walked in and thinks they can just do what they want!<br><br>I challenge you, here and now, to a fight, to prove who Praetoria's final Top Dog is!"
// Page FinalReese Text :
"P298913018" "<color orange>You've beaten Reese in combat. You can end his life here, once and for all, or spare him, allow him to live out his life here in Last Bastion."
// Answer Text :
"P3981399181" "(Kill Reese)"
// Answer Text :
"P248695889" "(Spare Reese)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1768125894" "You've got to hurry, {HeroName}, Vanguard is going to close the portal to Last Bastion!<br><br>The forces there are being overrun, but if you can get in there, you could do something! Just... just you need to know one thing before you go in..."
// AcceptString :
"P3733956995" "What is it?"
// SendOffString :
"P1195140692" "<color red>The portal will not take you back once you go in.</color> The only way to get back is if you can get the area secured. But... The only way to do that is to somehow get a message back to <i>here</i>.<br><br>That's where I come in! I'll be splitting a part of myself to monitor your activities. If things go well, I'll send the message to reactivate the portal. If they don't... well, then you're going to become really good friends with a part of me!<br><br><color orange>The reports we received from Serpent Drummer indicate that the force that's attacking is <i>massive</i>. You'll have to give it everything you've got to repel them!</color><br><br><color orange>{Hero.type=villain This whole suicide mission could throw a wrench in your plans. However, you're not about to let everything you worked for go to waste. You've fought off the Hamidon's forces several times now - it's time to show this creature that it's dealing someone it cannot hope to control.}"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3227885764" "Face Hamidon's Fury"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3904709731" "<color orange>Doctor Orts is concentrating on maintaining a connection for you.</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P638674139" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: New Earth</color>"

