// Script Variable Caption :
"P914011725" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>The Avatars of Hamidon are powering each other up!<t=5 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white>This is Metronome, I am in Anti-Matter's space station. I will provide the support to take these creatures down!"
// Script Variable Caption :
